Design diagram placeholder

This file is a placeholder for the required design diagram PDF. Please replace
this file with a draw.io exported PDF or a scanned PDF of your hand-drawn
datapath diagram. The diagram should show:

- Datapath components (ALU, register file, PC, pipeline registers)
- Control signal sources (control unit) and key control signals
- Instruction flow through the pipeline (IF, ID, EX, MEM, WB)
- Memory interfaces (imem and dmem)
- Where the Zba-specific decoding/logic is implemented (ID/EX and EX)

To produce a valid submission, replace this file with a proper PDF.
